'''''Hyoseris scabra''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Asteraceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form. Individuals can grow to 5&nbsp;cm tall.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Hyoseris scabra L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/6243174|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Hyoseris scabra (Annual Hyoseris) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/ASTR/Hyoseris_scabra.php |access-date=2022-03-03 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>

